the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    Antrag holds for *a case*.
    Antrag node 2 holds for *a case*.
    Antrag b holds for *a case*.
    Nur einmal referenziert holds for *a case*; open textured.
    Einfach referenziert holds for *a case*; open textured.

the knowledge base r6_2_accept_modular_with_single_parent includes:

the text of the_rulemap is at "sources/accept-modular-with-single-parent.ruml".

Antrag holds for a case if
    Antrag node 2 holds for the case
    and Antrag b holds for the case.

Antrag node 2 holds for a case if
    Nur einmal referenziert holds for the case.

Antrag b holds for a case if
    Einfach referenziert holds for the case.

